%% Diagram Sequence — SOS ke ack ke broadcast ke AI async ke dispatch-auto (Laya) ke dispatch + ETA
%% Grounded: backend/app/main.py, backend/app/ai_pipeline.py, backend/app/laya_dispatch.py,
%% docs/api-contract.md, lib/services/api_client.dart, lib/services/websocket_service.dart
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant W as Warga SosScreen
    participant L as LocationService
    participant C as ApiClient
    participant F as FastAPI 8791 main
    participant S as Store plus Audit
    participant WS as WS alerts broadcast
    participant AI as AI classify plus cluster
    participant LY as Laya 8010 dispatch
    participant K as Koordinator
    participant V as Relawan

    W->>L: currentPosition + accuracy
    L-->>W: lat lng accuracy_m
    W->>C: sendSos lat lng accuracy desc
    C->>F: POST /api/sos JSON
    F->>S: simpan tiket acknowledged P1 sos_default_pending_triage
    S-->>F: ok
    F->>S: audit create SOS
    F->>WS: create_task incident.sos tanpa tunggu AI
    F->>AI: BackgroundTask enrich ticket_id
    F-->>C: 201 tiket + X-SOS-Budget-S 5.0
    Note over F,C: ack di bawah 5 detik, kriteria 2
    C-->>W: Incident acknowledged
    WS-->>V: frame incident.sos
    WS-->>K: frame incident.sos
    AI->>AI: classify ai_category + confidence
    alt confidence di bawah 0.65 atau eskalasi urgency
        AI->>S: needs_review true + ai_triage_pending_review + audit ai_classify
    else confidence cukup
        AI->>S: metadata ai_* + audit ai_classify
    end
    AI->>AI: cluster 150m + 30 mnt + kategori kompatibel
    AI->>S: cluster_id + audit cluster
    AI->>WS: incident.ai_updated
    WS-->>K: ai_updated + review-queue
    opt koordinator koreksi
        K->>F: POST correct urgensi atau kategori
        F->>S: coordinator_corrected needs_review false + audit correct
    end
    opt koordinator split false-merge
        K->>F: POST split
        F->>S: cluster_id null + audit split
    end
    K->>F: POST dispatch-auto
    F->>LY: POST v1 systemone report ID-EN + questions
    alt Laya ok dan confidence min 0.5
        LY-->>F: required_roles + headcount source laya
    else timeout error atau conf rendah
        LY-->>F: gagal → heuristic_dispatch source fallback
    end
    F->>F: match_volunteers irisan peran + haversine terdekat
    F->>S: required_roles invited dispatch_source + audit dispatch_auto
    F->>WS: incident.dispatch_auto
    WS-->>V: undangan required_roles + reason
    V->>F: POST dispatch volunteer id
    F->>S: dispatched + dispatched_to + audit dispatch
    F->>WS: incident.dispatched + ETA via GET api eta OSRM atau stub
    WS-->>W: dispatched di StatusTimeline
    WS-->>K: dispatched
